Tacchan.

260
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,880
Tacchan.

261
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:57,240
Tacchan.

262
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:02,600
Yay!

263
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:06,640
Finally, you're calling me by my nickname,

264
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:09,920
"Tatchan, Tatchan,"
say it more, say it more!

265
00:16:11,300 --> 00:16:12,880
the rest of the message...

266
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:16,560
"Tatchan, are you free this Sunday?"

267
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:17,260
"Yeah."

268
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:22,100
"Um, if you don't mind,
would you like to go somewhere together?"

269
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:26,860
T-this must be what they
call a date invitation!

270
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:29,240
Yes! I did it!

271
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:34,320
She asked me out, she invited me,
she asked me on a date,

272
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:38,440
Saori asked me out on a date herself!

273
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,560
Of course I'm in!

274
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,920
CPR at sea or a panty shot
in a field would be tempting,

275
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:51,360
but first, to show off my own style,

276
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:54,680
the Nippon Budokan,
the holy land of martial artists!

277
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:57,540
Outfit.

278
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:00,080
I see, so I need to decide what to wear.

279
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,320
Alright, it's a date!

280
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,100
Tatchan.

281
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,560
Hey, sorry to keep you waiting, Saori-chan.

282
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,340
You came dressed like that?

283
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,040
What's wrong with it?

284
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,160
Tatchan, your taste is terrible.

285
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:27,120
I thought this was the
ultimate look for a real man.

286
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,400
Yes, go, go, right there!

287
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:34,580
Yes, we did it!

288
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:38,500
Wow, what an amazing match that was,
Saori-chan.

289
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:41,040
I'm not good at this kind of thing.

290
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:46,300
Oh no, so Saori hates judo?

291
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:50,160
I'm so thirsty.

292
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:53,820
Then how about this protein juice?

293
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:57,560
I'm going home.

294
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:03,900
Wait, Saori-chan!

295
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:06,340
Tatchan, I hate you.

296
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:17,780
Why?

297
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:22,960
No good.

298
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:25,320
Because I've never actually been on a date.

299
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:27,820
I have no idea what to do or how to do it.

300
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:30,080
That's it, I'll ask Ryotsu about this.

301
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:33,300
Wait a minute.

302
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,860
When it comes to dating,
he's more reliable than Ryotsu.

303
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:37,700
That's right, that guy!

304
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:43,340
Who could be calling at this hour?

305
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,360
Hello?

306
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,000
Sakonji-san?

307
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,920
Dating tips?

308
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,500
Yes! Yay!

309
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:59,360
This room's as noisy as ever

310
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:05,698
Yo, ma'am.

311
00:19:05,748 --> 00:19:08,820
Thanks for always doing this.

312
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,380
Are you Sakonji-san?

313
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:13,940
Yeah, the door lock's acting up.

314
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:15,740
R-really? I'll take a look.

315
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:28,740
What's wrong, you two?

316
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:33,540
Sakonji's been calling me over and over in
the middle of the night these past few days,

317
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:34,960
and I can't sleep.

318
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,200
You two aren't the only ones,

319
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:40,280
I'm getting calls from
him every hour or so too!

320
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,020
I can't sleep at all either.

321
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:44,780
His voice keeps echoing in my head,

322
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:47,220
Here's some coffee to wake you up.

323
00:19:47,220 --> 00:19:48,020
Thanks.

324
00:19:48,020 --> 00:19:48,960
Thank you for the food.

325
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:53,300
I wonder if Sakonji really has
no memories of his first love?

326
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:55,540
There is, you know.

327
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,840
This one's a masterpiece, you know.

328
00:19:57,840 --> 00:20:01,820
His first love was back in fourth grade.

329
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:07,940
Shike-kun.

330
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,360
Hey there.

331
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:11,780
Let's do our best today, okay?

332
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:12,500
Yeah.

333
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:17,680
It was love at first sight with a girl
who went to the same dojo.

334
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:24,360
How cute.

335
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:25,980
So he was quite the innocent one

336
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:27,540
But then...

337
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:37,200
He advanced smoothly
all the way to the final.

338
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,620
And his opponent in the final was

339
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:41,280
Ippon!

340
00:20:45,820 --> 00:20:47,520
And he was so shocked

341
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:52,820
that he went into the match having
forgotten to go to the toilet.

342
00:20:59,120 --> 00:20:59,940
Hajime!

343
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:01,440
Eeiit!

344
00:21:03,380 --> 00:21:04,400
Eeiit!

345
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:06,540
Eeeeeeeh!

346
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:12,140
Aaaaaaah!

347
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:14,220
Aaaaaaah!

348
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:16,980
Aaaaaaah!

349
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:17,400
Aaaaaaah!

350
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,400
Aaaaaaah!

351
00:21:34,780 --> 00:21:36,860
Sakonji's first love is over.

352
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:39,740
Too bad.

353
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:43,160
Ever since then,
Sakonji has turned his back on girls

354
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:46,100
and devoted himself
entirely to martial arts?

355
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:47,740
That's right.

356
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:52,460
Right, so the girls in the game won't throw him,
will they?

357
00:21:52,940 --> 00:21:53,734
No, I suppose not.

358
00:21:53,784 --> 00:21:57,160
Isn't this a good chance for him to break
away from only thinking about martial arts?

359
00:21:57,600 --> 00:22:01,680
Getting thrown by the girl in the game...

360
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:13,720
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!

361
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:19,520
I'll be waiting under the third cherry tree from the right...
It's finally here!!!!!

362
00:22:21,100 --> 00:22:26,480
What's going on, senpai?
Dokimemo has a secret event, you know.

363
00:22:31,420 --> 00:22:33,160
Tatchan, you were waiting

364
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:39,160
S-Saorin...

365
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:42,580
Actually, I've been thinking
about Tatchan all this time...

366
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:51,940
If you choose
"Actually, me too" in the final confession scene, something terrible happens...

367
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:55,700
Actually, me too.

368
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:03,420
Fine, let's fight.

369
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:08,520
Stop it.

370
00:23:11,540 --> 00:23:13,820
I don't want to fight you.

371
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,600
Sakonji

372
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:30,420
I hate weak people.

373
00:23:30,420 --> 00:23:31,280
Goodbye.

374
00:23:41,100 --> 00:23:42,340
I was too late

375
00:23:45,540 --> 00:23:46,680
Women are...

376
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,640
Women are...

377
00:23:49,380 --> 00:23:50,900
Enough already, please.

378
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:53,720
Isn't he worse than before?

379
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:54,920
Woman-hater.

380
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:59,340
His second love ended the same way,
after all.

381
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:08,320
How dare you interfere
with my business, Chief!

382
00:24:08,320 --> 00:24:09,760
And the station chief too.

383
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:14,160
I'll pay you back for this tenfold,
no, a hundredfold!

384
00:24:15,060 --> 00:24:17,240
Both of you, prepare yourselves.

385
00:24:17,660 --> 00:24:21,020
Next time: Ogeritsu Photo Panic.
See you then!

386
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:42,760
They say I'm a woman who can't fall in love,
but I have so many things I want to do. Me.

387
00:24:44,300 --> 00:24:52,040
I want to ride my motorbike
across a harsh desert.

388
00:24:52,040 --> 00:24:59,320
I want to be freer than a bird.

389
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:07,100
A lady's dreams that change
as fast as a kaleidoscope.

